sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Channel as Channel Handler<br/>(Telegram/WhatsApp/CLI)
    participant InboundQ as InboundQueue<br/>(AsyncIO)
    participant Agent as Agent Loop
    participant Context as Context Builder
    participant Session as Session Manager
    participant Memory as Memory Store
    participant Skills as Skills Loader
    participant LLM as LLM Provider<br/>(OpenRouter/Claude/etc)
    participant Tools as Tool Registry
    participant OutboundQ as OutboundQueue<br/>(AsyncIO)

    Note over User,OutboundQ: Phase 1: Message Reception
    User->>Channel: 1. Send message<br/>("What's the weather?")
    Channel->>Channel: 2. Validate sender<br/>(check allow_from list)
    Channel->>InboundQ: 3. publish_inbound()<br/>InboundMessage

    Note over User,OutboundQ: Phase 2: Context Assembly
    InboundQ->>Agent: 4. consume_inbound()<br/>Pop from queue
    Agent->>Context: 5. build_system_prompt()
    Context->>Context: 6. Load bootstrap files<br/>(AGENTS.md, SOUL.md, USER.md)
    Context->>Session: 7. get_history(limit=50)
    Session-->>Context: Recent messages
    Context->>Memory: 8. read_memory()
    Memory-->>Context: MEMORY.md + today's note
    Context->>Skills: 9. load_skills()
    Skills-->>Context: All skill definitions
    Context-->>Agent: System prompt assembled

    Note over User,OutboundQ: Phase 3: LLM Interaction (Iteration 1)
    Agent->>LLM: 10. chat(messages, tools)<br/>[system, history, user_msg]
    LLM-->>Agent: Response with tool_call<br/>web_search("weather Tokyo")

    Note over User,OutboundQ: Phase 4: Tool Execution
    Agent->>Tools: 11. execute_tool()<br/>web_search("weather Tokyo")
    Tools->>Tools: 12. Validate parameters<br/>(check JSON schema)
    Tools->>Tools: 13. Execute search<br/>(Brave API call)
    Tools-->>Agent: Tool result<br/>("Sunny, 22°C in Tokyo")

    Note over User,OutboundQ: Phase 5: LLM Interaction (Iteration 2)
    Agent->>LLM: 14. chat(messages + tool_result)
    LLM-->>Agent: Final response<br/>("The weather in Tokyo is...")

    Note over User,OutboundQ: Phase 6: Session Storage
    Agent->>Session: 15. save_message(user_msg)
    Agent->>Session: 16. save_message(assistant_msg)
    Session->>Session: 17. Append to JSONL<br/>(telegram-12345.jsonl)

    Note over User,OutboundQ: Phase 7: Response Dispatch
    Agent->>OutboundQ: 18. publish_outbound()<br/>OutboundMessage
    OutboundQ->>Channel: 19. dispatch_outbound()<br/>Callback invoked
    Channel->>Channel: 20. Format response<br/>(Markdown → HTML)
    Channel->>User: 21. Send response<br/>(Telegram API / WebSocket)

    Note over User,OutboundQ: Total Round Trip: ~1-3 seconds (+ LLM latency)
